<p><em>Team continues into an adjoining hallway. The distant sound of rushing water becomes more and more audible as they continue down the hallway, which now has far exceeded the external dimensions of the SouthWood Park Mall.</em></p>
<p><strong>Atlantis:</strong> Look there. That store, what language is the sign written in?</p>
<p><strong>Nine-Eyes:</strong> It's, uh&#8230; huh. It's not.</p>
